Arrr! Symfony be a powerful PHP web framework o' reusable components and an MVC architecture that helps ye build maintainable, scalable web applications without walkin' the plank. It uses bundles (treasure chests o' features), Composer for dependencies, and a handy CLI (bin/console), with LTS releases and a hearty community to keep yer ship afloat. Perfect fer everything from wee skiff projects to giant enterprise galleons.
